  "description": "OpenAI chat-completions-shape provider for Themia.AI's IAiCompletionProvider. One implementation reaches OpenAI, Ollama, Groq, Cerebras, LM Studio and vLLM by changing BaseUrl. Maps finish_reason and HTTP status onto AiOutcome, reads usage on every response that carries it, and sends the API key as an Authorization: Bearer header.",
